%% Figure 20: UML Sequence Diagram — Computer Vision & Meal Logging Flow
%% Standar: UML 2.5 Sequence Diagram, OopsieEats
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 Pengguna
    participant ScannerUI as 📱 ScannerScreen
    participant ScanProv as 🔄 ScanFlowProvider
    participant YoloProc as ⚡ YoloIsolateProcessor
    participant TFLite as 🧠 TFLite Interpreter
    participant ConfirmUI as 📋 DetectionConfirmationScreen
    participant PortionUI as ⚖️ PortionInputScreen
    participant SupaStorage as ☁️ Supabase Storage
    participant MealRepo as 📦 MealRepository
    participant Firestore as 🔥 Cloud Firestore

    User->>ScannerUI: Ambil Foto Makanan (Kamera / Galeri)
    ScannerUI->>ScanProv: processCapturedImage(imageFile)
    ScanProv->>YoloProc: runInferenceInIsolate(rawBytes)
    Note over ScanProv,YoloProc: Eksekusi dialihkan ke background Isolate via Isolate.run (0ms UI blocking)

    YoloProc->>YoloProc: Decode, rotasi EXIF, resize 640x640, normalisasi float32
    YoloProc->>TFLite: run(inputTensor, outputTensor)
    TFLite-->>YoloProc: Output Tensor [1, 33, 8400]
    YoloProc->>YoloProc: Non-Maximum Suppression (IoU 0.45, Conf >= 0.15)
    YoloProc-->>ScanProv: List<DetectionResult> (Bounding Boxes & 29 Kelas Pangan)
    ScanProv-->>ScannerUI: Selesai Inferensi (< 300ms)

    ScannerUI->>ConfirmUI: Navigasi ke DetectionConfirmationScreen
    ConfirmUI-->>User: Tampilkan Foto Berkotak Pembatas & Nama Makanan
    User->>ConfirmUI: Konfirmasi Hidangan Terdeteksi
    ConfirmUI->>PortionUI: Navigasi ke PortionInputScreen

    User->>PortionUI: Masukkan Bobot Porsi (misal 150 gram)
    PortionUI->>PortionUI: Hitung Gizi Deterministik Atwater (4P + 4C + 9F)
    User->>PortionUI: Klik "Simpan Catatan Makan"

    PortionUI->>SupaStorage: uploadMealImage(userId, mealId, compressedBytes)
    SupaStorage-->>PortionUI: URL Path: food-history-images/{uid}/{mealId}.jpg

    PortionUI->>MealRepo: createMeal(mealType, date, items, imagePath)
    MealRepo->>Firestore: Simpan Dokumen ke users/{uid}/meals/{mealId}
    Firestore-->>MealRepo: Sukses (Dokumen Tersimpan & Cache Diperbarui)
    MealRepo-->>PortionUI: MealRecord Model
    PortionUI-->>User: Notifikasi Berhasil & Alihkan ke Dashboard / Riwayat
